    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaguya \u2013 A Bullet Hell STG That\u2019s Friendly for Beginners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>About the Game</strong><br><i>Kaguya</i> is a classic vertical-scrolling bullet hell shooter with a gentler difficulty curve.<br>Battle your way through six stages (planned) using bombs and power shots to take down waves of enemies from all directions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.poster.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.webm?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.mp4?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Akari and Akane on a fully-voiced journey as they chat their way through intense battles, wiping out an army of AI machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a developer who <strong>loves bullet hells but isn't great at them</strong>, so it's built with accessibility in mind.<br>If you've ever felt overwhelmed by the genre, this is your chance to enjoy a <strong>&quot;kinder, gentler bullet hell experience!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, for seasoned players, we\u2019ve got you covered too\u2014with <strong>three difficulty modes: Normal, Hard, and Hell</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features full voice acting throughout!<br>...But since dodging bullets might keep you a little busy, we\u2019ve included a <strong>Library Mode</strong> so you can enjoy all the voiced lines at your own pace.<br>Dialogue will also change depending on how you play\u2014<strong>try to collect them all!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.poster.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.webm?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.mp4?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akari Mikado</strong><br>A third-year student at Kaguya High and the game's main heroine.<br>She puts on a cool and stoic front, but deep down she\u2019s earnest\u2014and secretly obsessed with mechs and giant robots.<br>She enters the battlefield wielding the \u201cEn-Tetsu\u201d blaster gun, built in her father\u2019s humble machine shop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/92f424fe5b73800c24da10a2870e50ad.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akane Hiiragi</strong><br>Akari\u2019s tactical navigator and longtime childhood friend.<br>She\u2019s energetic, outspoken, and keeps Akari grounded\u2014especially when her inner mech geek starts to spiral out of control.<br>Snarky comments and teasing are just part of their daily banter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/9cf45442b5ebbb36b8f5c40615834daa.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaguya \u2013 A Bullet Hell STG That\u2019s Friendly for Beginners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>About the Game</strong><br><i>Kaguya</i> is a classic vertical-scrolling bullet hell shooter with a gentler difficulty curve.<br>Battle your way through six stages (planned) using bombs and power shots to take down waves of enemies from all directions!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.poster.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.webm?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/5c493fd529416406ba6d2fe108a0380c.mp4?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Akari and Akane on a fully-voiced journey as they chat their way through intense battles, wiping out an army of AI machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created by a developer who <strong>loves bullet hells but isn't great at them</strong>, so it's built with accessibility in mind.<br>If you've ever felt overwhelmed by the genre, this is your chance to enjoy a <strong>&quot;kinder, gentler bullet hell experience!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, for seasoned players, we\u2019ve got you covered too\u2014with <strong>three difficulty modes: Normal, Hard, and Hell</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features full voice acting throughout!<br>...But since dodging bullets might keep you a little busy, we\u2019ve included a <strong>Library Mode</strong> so you can enjoy all the voiced lines at your own pace.<br>Dialogue will also change depending on how you play\u2014<strong>try to collect them all!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.poster.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.webm?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/c4e7e8b3bd55236cddf67e7ad538acf6.mp4?t=1751354334\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 <strong>Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akari Mikado</strong><br>A third-year student at Kaguya High and the game's main heroine.<br>She puts on a cool and stoic front, but deep down she\u2019s earnest\u2014and secretly obsessed with mechs and giant robots.<br>She enters the battlefield wielding the \u201cEn-Tetsu\u201d blaster gun, built in her father\u2019s humble machine shop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/92f424fe5b73800c24da10a2870e50ad.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Akane Hiiragi</strong><br>Akari\u2019s tactical navigator and longtime childhood friend.<br>She\u2019s energetic, outspoken, and keeps Akari grounded\u2014especially when her inner mech geek starts to spiral out of control.<br>Snarky comments and teasing are just part of their daily banter.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681000/extras/9cf45442b5ebbb36b8f5c40615834daa.avif?t=1751354334\" width=616 height=400 /></span></p>",
